Create gui_feature_test for automated GUI testing.

Headless or screenshot-based test that exercises GUI code paths without
requiring manual interaction.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Test initializes GUI in headless/offscreen mode
- [ ] Simulates key presses and mouse clicks
- [ ] Exercises major GUI flows: track select, step toggle, mode switch
- [ ] Verifies no crashes during GUI frame rendering
- [ ] Can run in CI (no display required)

## Test Plan
- [ ] Build and run gui_feature_test target
- [ ] Verify all simulated interactions complete without crash
- [ ] Run under ASan, verify no memory errors
